    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process, acquire a new customer"
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "take the contract to Ms. Hannover"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "input it into the database"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the contract is deemed okay"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "organize a suitable team"
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "and the process will come to an end."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "However, if there are any missing details,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "contact the customer directly"
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "and the process will also come to an end."
